0213: enhanced lighting, fewer copies and loads (same picture)

- Scene end: the bloom bright pass samples the EFB's single-sample color (its copy source) directly
  instead of a full-resolution copy of it, which was also made with bloom off.
- Receivers: an extra light's reach is tested before its flags are loaded (most lights miss a
  pixel).

